# Independent Assortment produces many different combinations

@left

- Fruit flies: 4 chromosome pairs
  - Two parental choices per pair
  - 2&#x2074; = 16 combinations
- Humans: 23 chromosome pairs
  - Two parental choices per pair
  - 2&#x00B2;&#x00B3; = 8,388,608 combinations

